  "thought": "For each available customer, compute the total distance from each truck to the customer and back to depot. Assign the active truck to the customer with the smallest ratio of its total distance to the best total distance among other trucks. This minimizes the chance of a large makespan by ensuring trucks serve customers they are relatively closest to. No waiting is implemented because it is rarely beneficial when all customers are known."
